<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners big buyers of S.Africa bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners big buyers of S.Africa bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				     Week to July 18   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		  14,039.95	   231,046.22</p>
<p>    - sales			12,702.17	   216,203.74</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)   1,337.78	    14,842.49</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
